{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "to-tracking-flow-1234",
    "name": "Game Promotion API - TO Tracking Flow",
    "description": "TO (Turnover) tracking flow testing with Smart Bonus Win Detection:\n\n**Flow Overview:**\n- Create promotion with turnover multiplier\n- Claim promotion\n- Update total win amount\n- Update total turnover (no promotionId required)\n- Calculate TO requirements\n- Check TO progress\n- Verify final state\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Tests the complete TO tracking workflow\n- Validates smart bonus win detection\n- Tests automatic promotion finding (FIFO > Earliest expiry > Highest win)\n- Verifies TO requirement calculations\n- Tests TO progress tracking\n- Comprehensive error handling testing\n- Tests new NO_ACTIVE_BONUS_WIN error scenario",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "18297178"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Create Promotion with Turnover Multiplier",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has promotion data', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('_id');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('code');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('bonusItemCount');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('operatorId');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('minTurnoverMultiplier');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Turnover multiplier is set correctly', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.minTurnoverMultiplier).to.equal(25);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Save promotion ID for next requests', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('promotionId', jsonData._id);",
              "    pm.environment.set('playerId', 'to_player_' + jsonData._id);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"TO Tracking Test Promotion\",\n  \"code\": \"TO_TEST_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"operatorId\": \"{{operatorId}}\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2024-12-31T23:59:59.000Z\",\n  \"bonusItemCount\": 10,\n  \"minTurnoverMultiplier\": 25,\n  \"currencyGroups\": [\"{{currencyGroup}}\"],\n  \"offeredSiteNames\": [\"{{siteName}}\"],\n  \"offeredPlayerIds\": [],\n  \"gameConfigType\": 2,\n  \"gameIds\": [{{gameId}}],\n  \"betLevels\": [\n    {\n      \"currencyGroup\": \"{{currencyGroup}}\",\n      \"betLevel\": 1.0\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/promotions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["promotions"]
        },
        "description": "Create a new promotion with turnover multiplier for TO tracking testing"
      },
      "response": []
    },
